&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In 6 months time; you will be able to add new features to the software with guidance from the product and engineering leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In 12 months time; you will have an area of speciality within the Motorsport team where you will be able to suggest new insights and solutions for future development.&lt;/li&gt;
